{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33798","headline":"太湖诗 投龙潭 · 皮日休","name":"太湖诗 投龙潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龟山下最深，恶气何洋溢。\n涎水瀑龙巢，腥风卷蛟室。\n晓来林岑静，狞色如怒日。\n气涌扑炱煤，波澄埽纯漆。\n下有水君府，贝阙光比栉。\n左右列介臣，纵横守鳞卒。\n月中珠母见，烟际枫人出。\n生犀不敢烧，水怪恐摧捽。\n时有慕道者，作彼投龙术。\n端岩持碧简，斋戒挥紫笔。\n兼以金蜿蜒，投之光焌律。\n琴高坐赤鲤，何许纵仙逸。\n我愿与之游，兹焉托灵质。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}